# Asteroids Game
This is a version of the classic Asteroids arcade game, implemented in Python using the arcade library. The game is fully playable from the terminal; no web or graphical interface is needed. You can navigate around the game using the keyboard. 

## Getting Started
- Be sure you have Python installed on your computer.
- Install the 'arcade' module: `pip install arcade`
- Clone or download the repository files to your computer.
